00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:29.440
in the skin you can use shorter wavelengths&nbsp;
that don't have to get down quite as far

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:33.920
apart from wavelength or colour there are tons of&nbsp;
other settings that can be adjusted to change how&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:38.800
a laser works on the skin there's the pattern of&nbsp;
the light whether it's a continuous beam of light&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:44.480
or whether it's short pulses how long each of&nbsp;
those short pulses are the gap between the pulses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:50.320
how much the beam is spread out and having so&nbsp;
