00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:38.480
and they're also less risky especially for people&nbsp;
with darker skin one of the biggest problems with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:43.040
laser treatments when it comes to people with&nbsp;
asian skin like mine or mediterranean skin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:49.200
or darker so most people in the world is that&nbsp;
our skin responds to trauma by producing pigment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:54.960
this is called post-inflammatory hyperpigmentation&nbsp;
or pih so if you're using a laser to try to blast&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.960 --> 00:05:00.640
away pigment which we often are because uneven&nbsp;
pigmentation is one of the main ways our skin ages&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:06.800
