00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:32.000
one of the most popular lasers is the&nbsp;
picosure focus which is the machine that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:36.880
i was treated with at neutral bay dermatology&nbsp;
the picosure focus has two special features&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:41.200
firstly there is a really short pulse duration&nbsp;
which means it fires really short blasts of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:45.680
light into the skin the pico part refers&nbsp;
to picoseconds which is how short these&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:50.480
blasts of light are each one lasts less than&nbsp;
1 billionth of a second and that means there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:54.560
