00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:39.440
the dermis and that means you can get plumper&nbsp;
skin and smoothing out of fine lines and wrinkles&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:43.920
and shallow scarring and because melanin&nbsp;
is what's turning the light into pressure&nbsp;&nbsp;

